^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ is_constructible<int> \(empty pack\) is true: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ is_constructible<D> \(user default ctor\) is true: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ is_constructible<ND> \(no default ctor\) is false: SUCCESS$
