--
N5008 [meta.unary.prop], [temp.variadic]/5: is_constructible<T> with an empty
argument pack is default-constructibility.  CBMC mis-evaluated the empty pack
(left as the empty pack name -> empty type, not nil) and wrongly reported false,
breaking std::stack and exprt::visit's traversal.  Now evaluated accurately.
assertion.4 FAILURE proves non-vacuity.
